p": "2026-03-11T13:50:34Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "9. X,  from Brooklyn, transformed from a scholastic chess teacher charging $10/hour into the \"Internet’s Chess Teacher\" with a multi-million dollar empire. His brand, Y, was born out of a specific frustration: traditional chess courses were often monotone, academic, and incredibly boring for beginners.  Most creators sell merchandise as their primary revenue, but X treats his YouTube channel (with over 7 million subscribers and 4 billion views) as a massive free top-of-funnel for his high-ticket educational courses and his 2024 New York Times bestseller, How to Win at Chess. By 2025, he had donated over $100,000 to scholastic chess programs, essentially \"funding his own future customers\" by ensuring the next generation remains hooked on the game. Id X and Y.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-11T13:50:44Z", "username": "Shubham", "text": "Levy?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-11T13:50:50Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Levy", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-11T13:50:54Z", "username": "Shubham", "text": "Gotha.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-11T13:50:59Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Gotamches", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-11T13:51:08Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Gothamchess", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-11T13:51:15Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "The brand is the online platform and not the YouTube channel name", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-11T13:51:26Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Mis